# All zero-area: two colinear triangles, no index-degenerate faces.
# The loader keeps these; whether the engine extracts output from
# area-less islands is engine behavior, so callers must assert only the
# exit/output contract (exit 0 iff a valid, non-empty mesh is written).
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 2 0 0
v 5 5 5
v 6 5 5
v 7 5 5
f 1 2 3
f 4 5 6
